      <title>VMware vCenter Server DCE/RPC Heap Overflow RCE (CVE-2024-37079)</title>
      <link>http://192.168.0.124:1313/pocs/network/2026-05-16_vmware-vcenter-dcerpc-heap-overflow-rce/</link>
